        "result": "{\"action\":\"research\",\"reason\":\"The user is asking for a comparison of MQTT vs NATS for IoT edge deployments \u2014 a comparison-of-named-products question that benefits from evidence gathering rather than a small-talk reply. Routing to the research category so the research-pack arc can scope the synthesis.\"}"
